  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance Agricole d&#x2019;urgence aux m&#xE9;nages vuln&#xE9;rables affect&#xE9;s par les cyclones Batsirai, Emnati (2022) et Freddy (2023) dans le Grand Sud-est de Madagascar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main aim of this $1.5m FAO project is to contribute to the quick restauration of livelihoods and to the improvement of food security of vulnerable households. To that end, FAO will distribute agricultural inputs (seeds) and live chickens, and conduct training. In total, FAO plans to reach 47,500 people, including 9,880 women and 14,820 girls.</narrative>
  </description>
